From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Herman van Hazendonk <github.com@herrie.org>
Date: Sat, 10 Oct 2026 22:29:17 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] droidcamsrc: send the zoom index, and read jpeg-quality as
 the int it is

Two properties never reached the HAL as asked:

- zoom: set_zoom() wrote the GstPhotography zoom as a float ("2.000000")
  into the Android "zoom" parameter, which is an index into "zoom-ratios"
  starting at 0, while droidcamsrc's zoom starts at 1 (see
  set_zoom_to_droid(), which does subtract the 1). Every zoom landed one
  step too far, and 1x could not be set back at all. Send the index.

- jpeg-quality: installed with g_param_spec_int() but read with
  g_value_get_uint() and written with g_value_set_uint(), so setting it
  raised "g_value_get_uint: assertion 'G_VALUE_HOLDS_UINT (value)' failed"
  and stored 0, which then went to the HAL as the JPEG quality. Use the
  int accessors.

The jpeg-quality assertion is the one the LuneOS camera hit on the Unihertz
Q25 (Halium); the zoom offset follows from set_zoom() and
set_zoom_to_droid() disagreeing.

Signed-off-by: Herman van Hazendonk <github.com@herrie.org>
Upstream-Status: Pending
---
 gst/droidcamsrc/gstdroidcamsrc.c            | 4 ++--
 gst/droidcamsrc/gstdroidcamsrcphotography.c | 4 +++-
 2 files changed, 5 insertions(+), 3 deletions(-)

diff --git a/gst/droidcamsrc/gstdroidcamsrc.c b/gst/droidcamsrc/gstdroidcamsrc.c
index abfd8b3..671ee9c 100644
--- a/gst/droidcamsrc/gstdroidcamsrc.c
+++ b/gst/droidcamsrc/gstdroidcamsrc.c
@@ -351,7 +351,7 @@ gst_droidcamsrc_get_property (GObject * object, guint prop_id, GValue * value,
       break;
 
     case PROP_JPEG_QUALITY:
-      g_value_set_uint (value, src->jpeg_quality);
+      g_value_set_int (value, src->jpeg_quality);
       break;
 
     default:
@@ -508,7 +508,7 @@ gst_droidcamsrc_set_property (GObject * object, guint prop_id,
       break;
 
     case PROP_JPEG_QUALITY:
-      src->jpeg_quality = g_value_get_uint(value);
+      src->jpeg_quality = g_value_get_int (value);
       gst_droidcamsrc_apply_mode_settings (src, SET_AND_APPLY);
       break;
 
diff --git a/gst/droidcamsrc/gstdroidcamsrcphotography.c b/gst/droidcamsrc/gstdroidcamsrcphotography.c
index 23a8cc6..6bddd23 100644
--- a/gst/droidcamsrc/gstdroidcamsrcphotography.c
+++ b/gst/droidcamsrc/gstdroidcamsrcphotography.c
@@ -1338,7 +1338,9 @@ gst_droidcamsrc_set_zoom (GstDroidCamSrc * src, gfloat zoom)
   src->photo->settings.zoom = zoom;
   GST_OBJECT_UNLOCK (src);
 
-  value = g_strdup_printf ("%f", zoom);
+  /* Android's "zoom" is an index into "zoom-ratios" starting at 0, while
+   * ours starts at 1; see gst_droidcamsrc_photography_set_zoom_to_droid(). */
+  value = g_strdup_printf ("%d", MAX ((int) zoom - 1, 0));
   ret = gst_droidcamsrc_set_and_apply (src, "zoom", value);
 
   GST_DEBUG_OBJECT (src, "zoom set to %s", value);
-- 
